    {
      "id": "2124695480013636039",
      "text": "Nembhard gets Brunson called for his fourth foul. The Garden is displeased. Nembhard misses the first free throw so they take it as ball-don't-lie but he gets the second, it's a 3-point game and Brunson checks out for the moment.",
      "url": "https://x.com/DustinDopirak/status/2124695480013636039",
      "published": "2026-11-23T02:44:12+00:00",
      "likes": 0,
      "author": "Dustin Dopirak",
