      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2124694012565258431",
      "text": "Siakam the floater through contact and he draws the foul from Bridges. Makes the free throw and it's a six-point game. Slows the free fall at least. Might be the start of them getting back in it.",
      "url": "https://x.com/DustinDopirak/status/2124694012565258431",
      "published": "2026-11-23T02:38:22+00:00",
      "likes": 0,
      "author": "Dustin Dopirak",
      "handle": "DustinDopirak",
