      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2124692808930123827",
      "text": "Nembhard turns it over. Hart takes it the distance for the dunk and it's 67-55. Nembhard then called for an offensive foul. And we're in the midst of the Pacers' nightly danger zone period.",
      "url": "https://x.com/DustinDopirak/status/2124692808930123827",
      "published": "2026-11-23T02:33:35+00:00",
      "likes": 3,
      "author": "Dustin Dopirak",
      "handle": "DustinDopirak",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1749834508944248832/IgjSNTjb_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2124691919976714298",
      "text": "Pacers 1 of 6 from the floor to start the third. Towns hits a 3 and the Knicks goup 10. Siakam gets into it with the officiating and he gets a tech. (Siakam's frustration level has been high of late, as has probably been obvious to everyone.",
      "url": "https://x.com/DustinDopirak/status/2124691919976714298",
      "published": "2026-11-23T02:30:03+00:00",
      "likes": 1,
      "author": "Dustin Dopirak",
