      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1749834508944248832/IgjSNTjb_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "Since the first playoff series, Nesmith has made life difficult for Brunson. Aside from one blow-by he's been pretty good tonight too.",
